px;height:24px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--brand);color:var(--on-brand);display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:12px\">☰</span><span style=\"position:absolute;right:38px;bottom:8px;width:24px;height:24px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--brand);color:var(--on-brand);display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:12px\">?</span></div></div></li></ul></div></div><section><div class=\"section-title\">组成结构 · Anatomy</div><div class=\"anat-wrap\"><div class=\"anat-stage\"><div class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"area\"><div class=\"back-top-scene\">\n      <i class=\"back-top-line\" style=\"width:82%\"></i>\n      <i class=\"back-top-line\" style=\"width:64%\"></i>\n      <div class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"btn\" style=\"position:absolute;right:14px;bottom:14px\"><button class=\"back-top-btn\"><span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"icon\">↑</span></button></div>\n    </div></div></div><div class=\"anat-parts\"><div class=\"anat-part\" data-ap=\"area\"><button class=\"anat-part-trigger\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\"><span class=\"idx\">1</span><span class=\"pn\">页面区域</span><span class=\"pe\">Viewport</span></button><span class=\"pd\">滚动到页面较深处后，按钮再浮现</span></div><div class=\"anat-part\" data-ap=\"btn\"><button class=\"anat-part-trigger\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\"><span class=\"idx\">2</span><span class=\"pn\">悬浮按钮</span><span class=\"pe\">FloatButton</span></button><span class=\"pd\">固定右下角，点击平滑滚回顶部</span></div><div class=\"anat-part\" data-ap=\"icon\"><button class=\"anat-part-trigger\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\"><span class=\"idx\">3</span><span class=\"pn\">图标</span><span class=\"pe\">Icon</span></button><span class=\"pd\">使用清楚的向上箭头；含义不明确时补充文字说明</span></div></div></div></section><section><div class=\"section-title\">常见变体 · Variants</div><div class=\"variant-grid\"><div class=\"variant-card\"><div class=\"variant-name\">圆形按钮<span>Circle</span></div><div class=\"variant-demo\"><button class=\"back-top-btn\">↑</button></div><div class=\"variant-when\">适合常规页面的紧凑默认形态</div></div><div class=\"variant-card\"><div class=\"variant-name\">方形按钮<span>Square</span></div><div class=\"variant-demo\"><button class=\"back-top-btn square\">↑</button></div><div class=\"variant-when\">界面偏方正时，与其他按钮风格保持一致</div></div><div class=\"variant-card\"><div class=\"variant-name\">带文案<span>With Text</span></div><div class=\"variant-demo\"><button class=\"back-top-btn pill\">↑ 顶部</button></div><div class=\"variant-when\">需要明确说明按钮作用时</div></div></div></section><section class=\"scenes\"><div class=\"section-title\">典型使用场景</div><div class=\"scene-list\"><div class=\"scene-item\"><div class=\"scene-cap\">电商商品列表</div><div class=\"scene-shot is-plain\"><div class=\"sc-body\"><div class=\"sc-body-inner\"><div class=\"backtop-sc\" style=\"border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:10px;background:var(--bg);padding:10px;box-shadow:var(--shadow-card)\">\n      <div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:8px\">\n        <div style=\"border:1px solid var(--border-light);border-radius:8px;padding:8px\">\n          <div style=\"height:42px;border-radius:6px;background:var(--bg-soft);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:20px\">🎧</div>\n          <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:5px\">降噪耳机 Pro</div>\n          <div style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--red);font-weight:700\">¥ 899</div>\n        </div>\n        <div style=\"border:1px solid var(--border-light);border-radius:8px;padding:8px\">\n          <div style=\"height:42px;border-radius:6px;background:var(--bg-soft);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:20px\">🎒</div>\n          <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:5px\">户外双肩包</div>\n          <div style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--red);font-weight:700\">¥ 239</div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <span class=\"backtop-sc-btn\">↑</span>\n    </div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"scene-item\"><div class=\"scene-cap\">长文阅读